{"id": "61564", "title": "养女小兮", "author": "朱小妹", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 7, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/61/61564.htm", "intro": "鲜网文 养父文，宠文，有虐\r\n\r\n虐点是小姑娘的爹虽然是爱她的，但是表达爱的方式不对，让女主觉得她爹并没有把她放在心上，\r\n\r\n所以一段不平等的感情总是会引发矛盾的，后来女主离开了3年，男主悔过重新去找她了。", "base": "files/article/html/61/61564", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "9083430.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-13", "file": "9083432.html", "available": false}, {"title": "14-21", "file": "9083433.html", "available": false}, {"title": "22-29", "file": "9083434.html", "available": false}, {"title": "30-36", "file": "9083436.html", "available": false}, {"title": "37-42", "file": "9083438.html", "available": false}, {"title": "43-51", "file": "9083439.html", "available": false}]}